      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Against a Storm opponent with only 2 permanents, Gem3P Spike already has 2x Force of Will in hand for counter protection. Drawing a third free counterspell (Force of Negation) instead of Murktide Regent means they have no clock to pressure the opponent. Storm decks will eventually assemble enough resources to fight through counters, so deploying a fast threat is often more important than stacking redundant interaction.",
      "action_taken": "Ordered cards to draw Force of Negation, putting Murktide Regent and Leyline Binding deeper in the library.",
      "better_line": "Draw Murktide Regent to deploy a fast clock (can delve away many instants/sorceries from graveyard for a large flier), forcing the Storm opponent to combo quickly or lose. Two Force of Wills already provide strong protection while closing the game.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 176,
      "player": "Gem3P Spike",
      "decision_index": 162,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GPT5n Coach cast Thoughtseize targeting themselves instead of their opponent. Thoughtseize forces a player to reveal their hand and discard a nonland card, and costs 2 life. Targeting yourself means you lose 2 life (going from 7 to 5), reveal your own hand, and discard one of your own cards — all for no benefit whatsoever. The opponent has 4 untapped lands (Misty Rainforest x2, Flooded Strand x2) and unknown cards in hand that could include countermagic or interaction. Targeting the opponent would provide critical information and strip a key card.",
      "action_taken": "Targeted themselves with Thoughtseize, losing 2 life and discarding one of their own cards for zero benefit.",
      "better_line": "Target Gem3P Spike with Thoughtseize to see their hand and strip a counterspell or other interaction before attempting to combo off with Dark Ritual, Lion's Eye Diamond, and Echo of Eons.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 198,
      "player": "GPT5n Coach",
      "decision_index": 171,
    }
  ],
